1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,000
你每问 AI 一个问题，
Every question you ask an AI

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,820
它可能都在偷偷“喝水”。
may come with a secret sip of water.

3
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:06,200
一项估算说：聊几十个问题，
One estimate: a few dozen questions

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,690
就要喝掉一瓶五百毫升的水。
can cost a 500 ml bottle of water.

5
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:09,970
AI 又没有嘴，
AI has no mouth.

6
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,520
水到底喝到哪去了？
So where does the water go?

7
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,700
今天的烧脑问题：电脑算题，
Today's brain teaser: computers do math.

8
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,990
为什么要用水？
Why do they need water?

9
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:17,260
认识小芯，一块 AI 芯片。
Meet Chip, an AI chip.

10
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,820
它吃进去的电，几乎全变成了热。
Almost all the power it eats turns into heat.

11
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,040
以前一个机柜大约三到十千瓦，
An old server rack used about 3 to 10 kilowatts.

12
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,540
AI 机柜到了三十到一百千瓦。
An AI rack: 30 to 100.

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,970
相当于把十几到几十台电暖气，
That's like stuffing dozens of space heaters

14
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,310
塞进一个衣柜。
into one wardrobe.

15
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,510
不赶紧散热，
Without cooling,

16
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:32,430
芯片就会热到降速，甚至宕机。
the chip slows down, or even crashes.

17
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:33,620
最省钱的办法：
The cheapest fix:

18
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,100
让小芯“出汗”。
make Chip sweat.

19
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,740
人出汗，汗水蒸发，
When you sweat, the sweat evaporates

20
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,310
把身上的热带走。
and carries heat away.

21
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:40,350
数据中心的冷却塔也一样：
Data center cooling towers do the same:

22
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:42,000
让水蒸发，带走热。
evaporate water, dump the heat.

23
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,070
一升水蒸发，
One liter of water evaporating

24
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:45,520
能带走大约零点六度电的热。
carries off about 0.6 kilowatt hours of heat.

25
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,280
反转一：这水不是“用了”，
Twist one: the water isn't used up.

26
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,340
是“飞走”了。
It flies away.

27
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,230
它变成水汽飘到天上，
It becomes vapor in the sky,

28
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:51,860
不回本地的河里。
not water back in the local river.

29
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,450
一个中型数据中心，
A medium data center

30
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:55,860
每天要蒸发大约一百万升水。
evaporates about a million liters a day.

31
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,090
我们粗算一下：
Our rough math:

32
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:59,660
差不多是小半个奥运标准泳池。
that's close to half an Olympic pool.

33
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,640
全世界算下来，二零二五年
Worldwide in 2025,

34
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:04,400
数据中心冷却用水约二千二百亿升。
data center cooling used about 222 billion liters.

35
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,690
到二零三零年，
By 2030 it could hit 644 billion.

36
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:08,950
可能涨到六千四百亿升，差不多三倍。
Nearly three times as much.

37
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:11,570
中国这边，有团队估算二零三零年，
In China, one team estimates that by 2030,

38
00:01:11,570 --> 00:01:14,150
一年要用掉大约十九个西湖的水。
it's about 19 West Lakes of water a year.

39
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:15,620
反转二：越省电，
Twist two: saving power

40
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:17,040
有时候越费水。
can cost more water.

41
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,480
蒸发降温很省电，
Evaporative cooling saves electricity,

42
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,860
所以大家爱用。
so everyone loves it.

43
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:21,740
改用风扇吹、空调冷，
Switch to fans and air conditioning:

44
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:23,540
水省了，电就多了。
less water, more power.

45
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:27,460
一项调查：八成多的运营商挑冷却方案时考虑省电，
One survey: 87 percent of operators think about power,

46
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,460
考虑省水的只有三成多。
only 35 percent about water.

47
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,600
反转三：数据中心爱建在哪？
Twist three: where do data centers go?

48
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,540
电便宜、天气凉的地方。
Cheap power, cool weather.

49
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:36,510
可全球大约百分之四十五的数据中心，
Yet about 45 percent of them

50
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:37,860
在缺水的地区。
sit in water-stressed places.

51
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:41,330
在智利，谷歌一个项目原计划每年用七十亿升水，
In Chile, a Google project planned 7 billion liters a year,

52
00:01:41,330 --> 00:01:43,340
相当于八万人一年的用水。
as much as 80,000 people use.

53
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:45,110
居民反对、法院介入，
Residents objected, a court stepped in,

54
00:01:45,110 --> 00:01:46,640
最后改成了风冷。
and it switched to air cooling.

55
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,490
内蒙古乌兰察布规定：
Ulanqab in Inner Mongolia now says:

56
00:01:48,490 --> 00:01:51,570
不准用地下水冷却，只能用再生水。
no groundwater for cooling, recycled water only.

57
00:01:51,570 --> 00:01:53,340
好消息是，每度电用的水
Good news: water per kilowatt hour

58
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:54,590
在一年年变少。
keeps dropping.

59
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:56,800
坏消息是，AI 长得更快，
Bad news: AI grows even faster,

60
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,280
总用水量还在涨。
so total water keeps rising.

61
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:00,350
这就像你换了辆省油的车，
It's like buying a fuel-saving car

62
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:01,500
却越开越远。
and then driving much farther.

63
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:04,250
友情提示：一个问题喝多少水是估算，
Fine print: water per question is an estimate.

64
00:02:04,250 --> 00:02:06,470
不同模型、不同地方差很多。
It varies a lot by model and place.

65
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:08,780
用风冷、在冷地方的数据中心，
Air-cooled data centers in cold places

66
00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:10,210
几乎不怎么喝水。
drink very little.

67
00:02:10,210 --> 00:02:12,280
所以电脑算题为什么要用水？
So why does computing need water?

68
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:15,250
因为算力就是热，水是最便宜的“汗”。
Because compute is heat, and water is the cheapest sweat.

69
00:02:15,250 --> 00:02:17,360
下次 AI 回答得又快又好，
Next time AI answers fast,

70
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,280
别忘了它可能出了一身汗。
remember it may have broken a sweat.

71
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,010
小芯说：多问好问题，
Chip says: ask good questions,

72
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:22,750
我的汗才没白流。
so my sweat isn't wasted.

